Description: the JNI entry points are optional while Java is off
 With the Java bindings switched off (0001), libturbojpeg.so no longer exports
 its 31 Java_org_libjpegturbo_* JNI functions, and dpkg-gensymbols (check level
 4) fails because the symbols file lists them as required. Only
 libturbojpeg-java calls them. Mark them optional.
Author: Yohane Linux Maintainers <aqours@koiren.ai>
Forwarded: not-needed

